{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/93051-first-solar-eclipse-in-over-1-000-years-ry-763","id":93051,"title":"First Solar Eclipse In Over 1,000 Years (RY 763)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-03-17T16:22:56-07:00","id":93051,"title":"First Solar Eclipse In Over 1,000 Years (RY 763)","content":"I would like some assistance with ideas for what might happen during the First Solar Eclipse in over 1,000 years, which takes place in RY 763. I plan on using these ideas in my Chronicle, but I see no reason that they can't be used in anyone's particular Chronicle -- either as backstory/prelude or as something that takes place in the future <i>(For Chronicles set in the past, like mine)</i>.<br /> <br /> <br /> First though, some quick primer on my Chronicle.<div style=\"margin-left:40px\">It is a Realm Dragon-Blooded game set in RY 700, so I have a few decades to go before the Jade Prison is opened and the Anathema are released upon Creation <i>(Solars, Abyssals and Infernals are released upon Creation -- Not counting the 20-or-so Solars who have been Exalting since the Usurpation...)</i>. The Realm is Ascendent, the Satrapies are acquiescent, the Tepet Legions still exist, and the Dragon-Blooded are the Supreme Rulers of Creation. In other words, it is as the world is described <i><b>before </b></i>the Jade Prison is opened and the Empress disappears.</div>Take a read of the below, and I'll catch you below with my thoughts:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong> Ink Monkeys Ultimate Collection, Page: 163</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><b>Solar EcIipses</b><br /> &quot;Rarest of all solar events, the last solar eclipse occurred in RY 763 and signaled the return of the Solar Exalted. A solar eclipse had not been seen for more than a thousand years before that, and predicting the next one is a feat worthy of only the most skillful astrologers. No one knows why Ignis Divine orders the moon to cover the sun, but when he does, all Creation takes heed.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <br /> ...and...<br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><b>Calibration</b><br /> &quot;The Daystar flies a lonely vigil through Creation\u2019s skies during the five days of Calibration, banishing the absolute darkness of a starless night when it rises and calling down an ebon curtain when it sets.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Calibration is an eerie time aboard the Daystar. The Ebon Dragon seems to writhe and smile in those murals which depict his hated visage, relishing the fact that for five days, Creation will experience periods of absolute light and dark, paying homage to the duality that defines his relationship with the Unconquered Sun and his continuing mark upon the world. Strange echoes rattle through the superstructure, and Gardullis stirs uneasily in his sleep. The lumina emerge from the walls and floors of the Daystar and walk its halls for these five days; occasionally, they find the Things That Dwell in Corners coalescing in quiet, out-of-the-way parts of the station, and wordlessly slay these least among all demons.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Each year, on one day during Calibration\u2014the precise day changes from year to year and is impossible to predict\u2014the Daystar is unable to monitor Creation. Its screens show only blackness. This fact is one of the most closely guarded secrets of the Station Indomitable.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> ...also, see page 162 for <b>Daymoons</b> &amp; <b>Auroras</b>...</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> The Solar Eclipse isn't <b><i>specifically </i></b>set during Calibration, but I was going to have it happen during the First Day of Calibration. I was going to have the Solar Eclipse be sudden, with no warning <i>(Per the above...)</i>, and have it take place at Mid-Day and last for several hours on both sides of the mid-day hour <i>(I have entertained the idea of it being a full-day Solar Eclipse....)</i>.<br /> <br /> I can imagine that, with all the tension and superstition surrounding Calibration, that there would be panic and perhaps some violence. Among &quot;Mortals&quot;, only a few ancient Exalted remember the last Solar Eclipse. The rest of Creations population knows only legends and tales of the Darkened Sun, which happened over a Thousand Year ago <i>(Perhaps during the Usurpation ??)</i>.<br /> <br /> So, I was wondering, what sort of things -- Mundane and Supernatural -- do you think would happen during the Solar Eclipse? What about the rest of this particular Calibration? Let your imaginations loose.<br /> <br /> Thanks in advance.<br /> <br /> Peace.<br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#0000CD\">(Note: I'll post some of my own ideas a little later. I don't want to &quot;taint&quot; anyone's ideas, per se...)</span></i><br /> <br /> <br /> ~ N","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;There is timing in everything. Timing in strategy cannot be mastered without a great deal of practice. There is also timing in the Void. You win battles with the timing in the Void born of the timing of cunning by knowing the enemies' timing, and thus using a timing which the enemy does not expect.&quot; <i>Shinmen Musashi no Kami Fujiwara no Genshin, Go Rin No Sho (The Book of the Five Rings)</i>","edited":{"userid":2141,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2141-nadrakas","user":"Nadrakas","date":"03-17-2014, 09:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2141-nadrakas","name":"Nadrakas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2141_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"278"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-17T17:12:22-07:00","id":93082,"title":"","content":"Ooh, that's a cool idea. I am going to plagiarize this.<br /> <br /> Ok, during an Eclipse, I propose that you should be able to walk through a Shadowland into the Underworld as though it were night. Furthermore, during the brief period of an Eclipse, the Sun should shine in the Underworld as if it actually existed there. Ghosts disagree on whether this is a good omen or a bad one.<br /> <br /> Raksha are not subject the the effects of Calcification during an Eclipse.<br /> <br /> Muggles will drop whatever they are doing and either hide or gawk, depending on how much they fear portentous events.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>On the frontier of the Wild South, there's only one woman with the grit to take on its most dangerous outlaws and bring them <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/984977-back-alive-or-maybe-dead-quest\" target=\"_blank\">Back Alive, or Maybe Dead.</a><br /> <br /> Avatar by <a href=\"http://puzzlinghappenstance.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">K.S. Brenowitz</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/908-semicasual","name":"semicasual","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar908_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2499"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-17T22:21:22-07:00","id":93231,"title":"","content":"It seems the exact sort of thing that there will be some kind of demon escaping during it.<br /> I can well imagine a 3rd or 2nd circle soul of the Ebon Dragon having the condition that it can escape Malfeas &quot;when the sun is Eclipsed during Calibration&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-17T23:24:13-07:00","id":93261,"title":"","content":"I would hesitate to have too much bad stuff like demons escaping happen during an eclipse: it's supposed to be an &quot;extremely auspicious event&quot;, a symbol of the unity of Heaven (since the Sun, the Moon and the Maidens are all visible in the sky).<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Edition Core Rulebook</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">When the Solars returned, the world witnessed the first solar eclipse since the Terrestrial Exalted took power.</div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/815-kazorh","name":"Kazorh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar815_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-17T23:36:08-07:00","id":93268,"title":"","content":"Riots in the street, brawls in the saloons, necking in the parlor.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-18T01:13:14-07:00","id":93302,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kazorh</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/93051-first-solar-eclipse-in-over-1-000-years-ry-763?p=93261#post93261\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would hesitate to have too much bad stuff like demons escaping happen during an eclipse: it's supposed to be an &quot;extremely auspicious event&quot;, a symbol of the unity of Heaven (since the Sun, the Moon and the Maidens are all visible in the sky).<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Sure... it'd just be the one, specific second or third circle demon (something that happens once in 1000 years is too restrictive for a first-circle, so it wouldn't be a whole breed.<br /> <br /> If it's so auspicious, then likely big festivals, and people will assume that whatever's happened recently, or will happen soon, is a good thing.<br /> Priests will run around trying to work out what's happened, astrologers will be swamped with work, and there'll be wildly varying ideas as to what it could mean.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-18T02:21:32-07:00","id":93329,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1hB_TwDZ8yWopdyliJFITmm-0aSPHalKBNnPXjXjGo5c/edit\" target=\"_blank\">The Tzimime break free.</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-18T02:35:51-07:00","id":93333,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kazorh</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/93051-first-solar-eclipse-in-over-1-000-years-ry-763?p=93261#post93261\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would hesitate to have too much bad stuff like demons escaping happen during an eclipse: it's supposed to be an &quot;extremely auspicious event&quot;, a symbol of the unity of Heaven (since the Sun, the Moon and the Maidens are all visible in the sky).</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe it's a nice demon. Maybe it breaking free is part of what makes eclipses so auspicious.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/797631-why-craft-sucks-how-i-fixed-it\" target=\"_blank\">EX3 Craft Rewrite</a><br /> <br /> Sanctaphrax is not a person<br /> -Chejop Kejak","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1154-sanctaphrax","name":"Sanctaphrax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1154_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-18T08:19:45-07:00","id":93499,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/93051-first-solar-eclipse-in-over-1-000-years-ry-763?p=93231#post93231\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It seems the exact sort of thing that there will be some kind of demon escaping during it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not one demon, but three hundred.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-18T10:14:35-07:00","id":93556,"title":"","content":"Copypasta from my PBEM game:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Four years ago, Creation saw its first eclipse in over a millenium.<br /> <br /> Not many records still exist from the High First Age, when the last eclipse was seen. Most of Creation's people didn't even know it was possible for the Sun and Moon to come together in such a way. Nearly all saw the event as a portentious omen from the gods, although whether for good or ill was in hot debate.<br /> <br /> Fadaku of Tandesh was due to name and launch his new ship that day. The leaders of the Western Trade Alliance, which had commissioned the ship and mortgaged it to him, met and concluded that the day should be considered a day of rest for all operations, officially to honor the gods but actually motivated by an aversion to risk. But, by the time they concluded this, Fadaku had already gone ahead and named the ship in honor of the eclipse. He argued that when the gods embrace in the heavens, this is to be acknowledged, not avoided. They braced their temples and shook their heads, but once a ship is named, it is widely acknowledged to be bad luck to give it a new one. Thus, <i>Heaven's Embrace</i> took to the sea. </div> </div> </div>The eclipse is an extremely portentious event, but nobody agrees on what, exactly, it portends. You're going to have a lot of people more or less afraid to do anything that day, and a lot of people seeing it as a sign they should finally do that risky thing they've had on their mind forever, but since the eclipse isn't followed by any obviously related major event in most places, people will ultimately just shrug and get on with their lives.<br /> <br /> Think of real life events which have major implications on the future of the world. Russia has declared it's going to annex Crimea. What does an ordinary US citizen do with that information? Some might stockpile food because they think it's the first step to another world war. Most will probably shrug, decide the problem is out of their scope, and do what they would have done anyway.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2404,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2404-chant","user":"Chant","date":".  noticed a typo in copypasta source 03-18-2014, 01:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2404-chant","name":"Chant","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2404_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-18T10:26:08-07:00","id":93566,"title":"","content":"<i>And for one time in his life of power and control (Kyrie Eleison)<br /> Peleps Deled felt a twinge of fear for his immortal soul.</i><br /> <br /> But seriously, I imagine a wide assortment of Immaculate Monks seeing the eclipse as an ill-omen, a sign that the Heavens are actually paying attention to something on Creation. Usually, the Heavens just let the world be the world; this is never a good sign. Those students of the Heptagram, and a good portion of the professors, might have some inkling of the original Mandate of Heaven, and see the solar eclipse as an 'aw shit' moment.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>I used to know things. Forbidden things.</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/306-brasstreader","name":"Brasstreader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar306_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-18T11:55:58-07:00","id":93651,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Brasstreader</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/93051-first-solar-eclipse-in-over-1-000-years-ry-763?p=93566#post93566\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><i>And for one time in his life of power and control (Kyrie Eleison)<br /> Peleps Deled felt a twinge of fear for his immortal soul.</i><br /> <br /> But seriously, I imagine a wide assortment of Immaculate Monks seeing the eclipse as an ill-omen, a sign that the Heavens are actually paying attention to something on Creation. Usually, the Heavens just let the world be the world; this is never a good sign. Those students of the Heptagram, and a good portion of the professors, might have some inkling of the original Mandate of Heaven, and see the solar eclipse as an 'aw shit' moment.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think the setting's assertion about the Immaculate Monks is that most of them genuinely believe that Anathema are evil spirits whose powers are stolen from the Sun and Moon. Under that interpretation, they wouldn't really have a reason to fear the wrath of the Incarnae, because they haven't committed any offense against them.<br /> <br /> However, they might fear the intentions of the Incarnae anyway. Immaculate monks believe that spirits should uphold the natural order of their domain. If this is the first eclipse since the fall of the Anathema's rule, then it'd be interpreted as an unnatural event, a sign that the mightiest of spirits have become derelict of their duty. An ill omen indeed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2404-chant","name":"Chant","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2404_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"117"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}